## Lore

The Zaayr are dragons that look carved from living crystal and pure magical energy, with
crystal wings, teeth and claws, blue-energy eyes and tongue, and a body that is warm to the
touch. Once thought to be natives of the Astral Plane, they are really a dying species that
hid there; perhaps a thousand remain in the whole Megaverse, and a couple of hundred - most of
them hatchlings - live among the people of Psyscape. Their crystal hide is a priceless
universal magic component, which is why the Splugorth and others have hunted them nearly to
extinction. Every Zaayr carries a racial memory of that hatred for the Splugorth and for
slavers.

## GM Notes

NPC-headed entry: the stat block is "NPC Villain & Optional Player Character as a Hatchling".
A player character is always a first-level hatchling, and all the usual dragon-hatchling limits
and conditions apply (the book points to the Rifts RPG hatchling notes, page 97). Hatchlings
are 70% of adult size.

Alignment: any, but many are anarchist (28%) or unprincipled (22%). Enemies: the Splugorth,
Necromancers, and evil beings (including other dragons) who hunt them for their hides; they
also loathe practitioners of Bio-Wizardry and Rune Magic and anyone who enslaves intelligent
beings. Allies: Psyscapers and champions of light.

Zaayr crystal: armor made from it is impervious to lasers and takes half damage from energy
attacks. A hatchling''s body holds enough crystal for over 25,000 magic items (1D4 M.D.C. per
marble-sized piece); it substitutes for any gemstone component in Techno-Wizard, Bio-Wizard or
alchemical work and boosts the resulting magic by 30%.

Adult figures (not playable): I.Q. 2D6+12, M.A. 2D6+12, M.E. 2D6+12, P.S. 2D6+26, P.P. 2D6+12,
P.E. 3D6+12, P.B. 4D6+12, Spd 2D6x10 running or 2D6x10+60 flying. M.D.C. 1D6x1000 + P.E. x2.
Horror/Awe Factor 17. P.P.E. 2D4x100. I.S.P. +100. Eight physical or psionic attacks per melee,
or four plus one by magic. Bonuses: +3 initiative, +2 strike, +2 parry and dodge, +3 pull punch,
+3 roll with impact, +1 on all saving throws. Bio-regeneration 1D4x10 M.D. per minute;
teleport +12%, dimensional teleport +30%; metamorphosis doubled; eye laser and flame breath
ranges doubled. Size: 15 to 20 feet (4.6 to 6 m) tall, up to 50 feet (15.2 m) long, wingspan
about 40-50 feet; 18 tons. Life span about 6000 years.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'zaayr-crystal-dragon');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'zaayr-crystal-dragon';

